- * without this, none of its Tailwind classnames (Modal/Drawer/Button/Alert/Skeleton/FormField/
- * PopoverPortal/ContactAvatar/MiniDatePicker/BottomTabBar) would ever be scanned.
+ * `@rapidmx/react-shared`'s components live - without these, none of its Tailwind classnames (Modal/
